** ------------------------------------------------------------
** CalculiX 3D Twisted & Tapered NACA Airfoil Blade (Static)
** Material: Ti-6Al-4V (E = 114 GPa, nu = 0.34, rho = 4.43e-9 t/mm^3)
** Root z = 0 fixed (NNFIX). Uniform 0.5 MPa pressure on pressure face (PRES).
** ------------------------------------------------------------
*INCLUDE, INPUT=all.msh
*INCLUDE, INPUT=NFIX.nam
*INCLUDE, INPUT=NTIP.nam

*MATERIAL, NAME=TI6AL4V
*ELASTIC
114000.0, 0.34
*DENSITY
4.43e-9

*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=Eall, MATERIAL=TI6AL4V

*BOUNDARY
NNFIX, 1, 3, 0.0

*STEP
*STATIC
*DLOAD
*INCLUDE, INPUT=PRES.dlo

*NODE FILE
U
*NODE PRINT, NSET=NNTIP
U
*EL FILE
S
*END STEP
